{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"agent_message","text":"接下来我会按这个结构实现：\n\n1. `main()`：固定读取底部图例，分离上半部分的环对象，用 8 邻域连通分量逐个找环；每个环通过其包围盒中的唯一灰色中心像素建立旋转中心，再用相对坐标集合直接判定 `k ∈ {1,2,4}`，最后把中心灰色替换成图例颜色。\n2. `generate_input()`：先随机生成若干个目标对称阶数，构造对应的单环模板。`k=4` 用方环/截角方环，`k=2` 用非正方形矩形环或受限随机的 180° 对称轮廓，`k=1` 用受限随机轮廓并拒绝掉误成 2/4 阶的样本。\n3. 放置与反验：把所有环随机放到不重叠画布上，底部再放 4 槽位图例（第 3 槽留黑），中心灰点按目标颜色预期着色后用 `main()` 反验；通过后写入目标文件并跑你给的两条自检，再删 `__pycache__`。"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_36","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python - <<'PY'\nimport random, numpy as np\n\ndef n4(r,c):\n    for dr,dc in ((1,0),(-1,0),(0,1),(0,-1)):\n        yield r+dr,c+dc\n\ndef n8(r,c):\n    for dr in (-1,0,1):\n      for dc in (-1,0,1):\n        if dr or dc: yield r+dr,c+dc\n\ndef boundary(s):\n    h,w=s.shape; out=np.zeros_like(s)\n    for r in range(h):\n      for c in range(w):\n        if s[r,c] and any(not (0<=rr<h and 0<=cc<w and s[rr,cc]) for rr,cc in n4(r,c)):\n          out[r,c]=1\n    return out\n\ndef comp(mask):\n    h,w=mask.shape; seen=np.zeros_like(mask,dtype=bool); cnt=0\n    for r in range(h):\n      for c in range(w):\n        if mask[r,c] and not seen[r,c]:\n          cnt+=1; q=[(r,c)]; seen[r,c]=1\n          for rr,cc in q:\n            for nr,nc in n8(rr,cc):\n              if 0<=nr<h and 0<=nc<w and mask[nr,nc] and not seen[nr,nc]: seen[nr,nc]=1; q.append((nr,nc))\n    return cnt\n\ndef order(mask):\n    h,w=mask.shape; cr,cc=h//2,w//2\n    pts={(r-cr,c-cc) for r,c in zip(*np.nonzero(mask))}\n    if {(-c,r) for r,c in pts}==pts: return 4\n    if {(-r,-c) for r,c in pts}==pts: return 2\n    return 1\n\ndef step_interval(L,R,cc,w):\n    L=random.randint(max(0,L-1), min(cc-1,L+1))\n    R=random.randint(max(cc+1,R-1), min(w-1,R+1))\n    return L,R\n\ndef build(order_target):\n  for _ in range(5000):\n    if order_target==4:\n      n=random.choice([5,7,9])\n      if random.random()<0.5:\n        solid=np.ones((n,n),dtype=bool)\n      else:\n        solid=np.zeros((n,n),dtype=bool)\n        widths=[n-2]+[n]*(n-2)+[n-2]\n        for r,wid in enumerate(widths):\n          L=(n-wid)//2\n          solid[r,L:L+wid]=1\n    else:\n      h=random.choice([5,7,9])\n      w=random.choice([5,7,9])\n      if order_target==2 and h==w:\n        w=random.choice([5,7,9])\n        while w==h: w=random.choice([5,7,9])\n      cr,cc=h//2,w//2\n      rows=[None]*h\n      center_width=random.choice(range(3,w+1,2))\n      L=(w-center_width)//2; R=L+center_width-1\n      rows[cr]=(L,R)\n      prev=(L,R)\n      for r in range(cr-1,-1,-1):\n        prev=step_interval(*prev,cc,w)\n        rows[r]=prev\n      if order_target==2:\n        for r in range(cr+1,h):\n          a,b=rows[h-1-r]\n          rows[r]=(w-1-b,w-1-a)\n      else:\n        prev=(L,R)\n        for r in range(cr+1,h):\n          prev=step_interval(*prev,cc,w)\n          rows[r]=prev\n      solid=np.zeros((h,w),dtype=bool)\n      for r,(L,R) in enumerate(rows): solid[r,L:R+1]=1\n    h,w=solid.shape; cr,cc=h//2,w//2\n    if not all(0<=rr<h and 0<=cc2<w and solid[rr,cc2] for rr,cc2 in [(cr,cc),(cr-1,cc),(cr+1,cc),(cr,cc-1),(cr,cc+1)]):\n      continue\n    ring=boundary(solid)\n    if ring[cr,cc] or comp(ring)\"'!=1 or order(ring)!=order_target: continue\n    return ring\n  return None\nfor k in [1,2,4]:\n  cnt=0\n  for _ in range(100):\n    if build(k) is not None: cnt+=1\n  print(k,cnt)\n  ring=build(k)\n  for row in ring: print('\"''.join('#' if x else '.' for x in row))\n  print()\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
